{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChainSafe/lodestar/pulls/10422","id":4891035914,"node_id":"PR_kwDOCD5_Gc8AAAABI4dJCg","html_url":"https://github.com/ChainSafe/lodestar/pull/10422","diff_url":"https://github.com/ChainSafe/lodestar/pull/10422.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ChainSafe/lodestar/pull/10422.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChainSafe/lodestar/issues/10422","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChainSafe/lodestar/pulls/10422/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChainSafe/lodestar/pulls/10422/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChainSafe/lodestar/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChainSafe/lodestar/issues/10422/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChainSafe/lodestar/statuses/6c49831117e19c4a38ad52950e0efaf49f203c33","number":10422,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: make the builder bid deadline configurable","user":{"login":"nflaig","id":38436224,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDM2MjI0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38436224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig","html_url":"https://github.com/nflaig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nflaig/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Builder API bid requests advertise a fixed 500ms deadline via `X-Timeout-Ms` and the p2p bid is selected at a fixed 500ms from the slot start. Bid value keeps rising towards the slot boundary, so an operator may want to trade proposal latency for a longer bidding window, or shorten it on a network where builders bid early.\n\n- add `--builder.bidDeadline` to configure the duration builders are given once block production starts, the default stays at 500ms and the value must be a positive integer\n- read the p2p bid pool after the same duration from the request rather than at a fixed slot offset, and only once the builder API requests settled, so p2p bids get the same window as builder API bids including the lag buffer\n- refuse to start if an explicitly configured deadline plus the 250ms lag buffer is not below the block production race cutoff of a post-gloas fork, as the local block would be selected at the cutoff before any bid block is produced. The cutoff stays at 2s on 12s slots, which caps the deadline at 1749ms on mainnet. The default is not checked so networks with short slots keep working as before\n- past the race cutoff, use a pooled p2p bid right away instead of waiting for pending builder API requests\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-16T16:08:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T21:08:53Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"601fa29ee04805d4d70f7a01642f55ba18431a66","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"wemeetagain","id":1348242,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDgyNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1348242?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wemeetagain","html_url":"https://github.com/wemeetagain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wemeetagain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wemeetagain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wemeetagain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wemeetagain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github